# Neon PostgreSQL Connection String
# Retrieve this from your Neon Console (https://console.neon.tech)
# Dashboard -> Connection Details -> Connection string (select SQLAlchemy or PostgreSQL)
#
# Supported formats:
# postgresql+psycopg://username:password@ep-xyz.region.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
# or standard Neon URL:
# postgresql://username:password@ep-xyz.region.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
